## Chapter 14 — 弘法利生 / XIV. Propagating the Dharma and Benefiting Sentient Beings

### Q01 对传统的反思

Quoted text: `accordant with principle and adapted to the times`

- 契理契机 — standard rendering.

Quoted text: `return to the source and clarify what is truly central`

- 正本清源 — good.

Quoted text: `the spread of the Dharma in every age has undergone its own modernization`

- Good.

### Q02 用智慧让世界变得更好

Quoted text: `devastated by the decade-long catastrophe`

- 十年浩劫 — same as Chapter 1; consider whether international readers need a gloss.

Quoted text: `the role of the Dharma is precisely to improve the user of the tool`

- Good metaphor.

### Q03 让佛法落地生根

Quoted text: `ghost-and-spirit worship, fixation on the afterlife, and mystification`

- 鬼神化、来世化、神秘化 — good.

Quoted text: `the broad mass of believers who merely pray and bow`

- 求求拜拜 — good.

Quoted text: `Humanistic Buddhism`

- 人生佛教 — standard.

### Q04 以利他心而不是功利心传灯

Quoted text: `set aside the religious form and start from the perspective of life wisdom`

- 去宗教化 — “set aside the religious form” is good.

Quoted text: `Do not think of immediately getting the other person to accept the Dharma`

- Good.

### Q05 以关心打动人心

Quoted text: `I rejoice that you have an altruistic heart`

- 随喜 — “rejoice” is standard.

Quoted text: `When your standpoint is different, the other person can sense it.`

- Good.

Quoted text: `put the cart before the horse`

- 本末倒置 — good idiom.

### Q06 佛法能解决社会问题吗

Quoted text: `Eliminating discrimination is something Buddhism has always advocated.`

- Good.

Quoted text: `Brahmanism was theocentric`

- 神本的 — clear.

Quoted text: `contempt chains`

- 鄙视链 — good loan-translation.

Quoted text: `unconditional great compassion and the great sympathy of seeing others as oneself`

- Standard for 无缘大慈、同体大悲.

### Q07 努力做就是了

Quoted text: `Perhaps because I am not too attached to results`

- Good.

Quoted text: `just keep doing your best`

- 努力做就是了 — clear.

